    "## QUESTION 1\n",
    "\n",
    "1. __Repeat the classification exercise using 2 different algorithms/models. Explain the differences between the 3 models__ (your original one, and the 2 new ones for this task).\n",
    "\n",
    "After I did some reasearch I decieded to use XGboost as my main model in the past assingment.\n",
    "So here are the 3 models I will be using for this task:\n",
    "- XGboost\n",
    "- Decision Tree\n",
    "- Random Forest\n",
    "\n",
    "The difference is found in how they make their predictions. \n",
    "\n",
    "Decision Tree: 1 tree. Its like those simple diagrams. Take this example:\n",
    "Should I use duck tape or WD-40 to fix this?\n",
    "Does it move? > Should it? if yes, use WD-40. If no, use duck tape.\n",
    "\n",
    "Random Forest: \n",
    "Instead of just using 1 tree, it uses several and each votes. Majoraty wins.\n",
    "\n",
    "XGBoost: \n",
    "Think of it as trees stacked on trees. Its the slowest but most accurate. \n"
   ]
